description=Turn vanilla garage doors and fence gates into remote-controlled auto doors. Craft a remote control, right-click a door to install and pair it - one remote can pair many doors, and you can remove the opener at any time. Keep the remote in your inventory and press K (rebindable) to open or close your doors from the driver's seat, no need to get out of the car. Locked doors still need their original key.
